{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01060","headline":"相和歌辞 登高丘而望远 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 登高丘而望远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登高丘而望远海，六鳌骨已霜，三山流安在。\n扶桑半摧折，白日沈光彩。\n银台金阙如梦中，秦皇汉武空相待。\n精卫费木石，鼋鼍无所凭。\n君不见骊山茂陵尽灰灭，牧羊之子来攀登。\n盗贼劫宝玉，精灵竟何能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}